@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@adminToken = change-me-use-a-long-random-string

### Notification behavior note
# Notifications are triggered by task creation and processed asynchronously by Bull + Redis worker.
# To enable worker in API process, set:
#   NOTIFICATION_WORKER_ENABLED=true
# Then create a task via /classes/{classId}/tasks and inspect notification_jobs in DB.

### Optional: Ensure registration is open before notification testing
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/config
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auth.registration_open": "true"
}
